This PR attempts to add model and service provider names into STT/LLM/TTS/VAD/EOU metrics. This should address https://github.com/livekit/agents/issues/2033

- used `provider` instead of `system` to accommodate all services instead of just LLM;
- some of them uses base_url domain name as the default provider name instead of fixed values;
- in case of unclear value, `unknown` is used;

Tested with a simple cascading and an OpenAI realtime agent:

- [x] Observing STT metrics with metadata
- [x] Observing TTS metrics with metadata
- [x] Observing LLM metrics with metadata
- [x] Observing Realtime metrics with metadata (w separate turn_detection or server-side semantic-vad)

